# Chat logs never go in. They are full of real players' character names, and they
# belong to the people who played the match rather than to this repository.
#
# Tests that read a real match sample skip themselves when it is not there, so a
# fresh clone still builds and runs green without one.
recordings/
*.log
*.txt
!README.md
BlitzballTracker.Tests/Fixtures/
